	(text "CAN INTERFACE — TCAN3413\n\nPOWER AND CONTROL\n- VCC/VIO: 3.3 V.\n- C14/C15: 100 nF supply decoupling.\n  Place close to IC1 supply pins.\n- STB: LOW = normal operation; HIGH = standby.\n  Tie LOW for always-on operation, or control from MCU.\n- FD1_Tx: MCU FDCAN1 TX to transceiver TXD.\n- FD1_Rx: Transceiver RXD to MCU FDCAN1 RX.\n\nBUS FILTERING AND PROTECTION\n- L1: Common-mode choke for CAN bus noise suppression.\n- D4: CAN bus ESD protection.\n  Place close to J2 with a short ground return.\n- C17/C18: 47 pF bus-to-ground filter capacitors.\n  Optional population; verify signal integrity.\n\nTERMINATION\n- R4/R5: 60.4 ohm each, 1% tolerance.\n  Total differential termination: 120.8 ohm.\n- C16: 4.7 nF split-termination capacitor to GND.\n- Enable termination only at the two physical bus ends.\n- For selectable termination, add a jumper in series\n  with the resistor branch.\n\nCONNECTOR AND TEST POINTS\n- J2: Pin 1 = CANH; pin 2 = CANL; pin 3 = GND.\n- TP4: CAN TXD logic signal.\n- TP5: CAN RXD logic signal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 82.804 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "eda0c90c-a120-471c-8c9b-460db568a951")
	)
